.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ------------------------------------------------------- scratch / temp
scratch/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log

# --------------------------------------------------- sequencing payloads
# Raw and intermediate data belongs in object storage or an accession, not here.
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq
*.fq.gz
*.bam
*.bai
*.cram
*.sam
*.vcf.gz
*.bcf
*.h5
*.h5ad
*.npz

# ------------------------------------------------- vendor / third-party PDFs
# Manufacturer protocols and papers. The notes in each project cite them by
# document number and revision, so they can be re-obtained from the vendor.
*.pdf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored, for the record:
#   atrandiWGS/atrandi_wgs.html  -- generated by tools/build_page.py, but it is
#                                   the deliverable and docs sites serve built
#                                   HTML, so it stays tracked (as upstream
#                                   scg_lib_structs does).
#   atrandiWGS/ref/              -- archived third-party reference (style source,
#                                   stylesheet, barcode whitelist); small, and
#                                   the notes are unverifiable without them.
